          "merged_at": "2021-04-15T18:28:11Z"
        },
        "body": "- **Converts a few cluster logging events from INFO level to DEBUG, which should help reduce log noise in callers**\r\n- Removes or updates broken links in README\r\n- Removes unused Travis config\r\n- Adds `// +build integration` tags to tests which connect to resources locally. To run these tests, use `go test --tags=integration`\r\n- Moves the test suite runner from `broker_test.go` to `common_test.go` for visibility\r\n- Suppresses log output during test execution\r\n- Fixes the connection pool tests (these were using the wrong function name capitalization)\r\n- Fixes the metadata inconsistency test, but leaves it gated behind `// +build integration`\r\n- Prevents panics in tests when iterating over two slices simultaneously\r\n- Disables tests which relied on sequentially-ordered partitions. Partitions are yielded in a random order as of f494d707, so these tests will pass or fail randomly until rewritten",
